-- title:
--   Crude depth guard (one child with multiplicity)
-- statement:
--   Under the hypotheses of the crude depth guard, but with the one-child recursion $A(e) \le E + s\,A(\lfloor (m-1)e/m \rfloor)$ for $e \ge d^{\beta}$ (and $A(e) \le 8 d^{\beta}$ below $d^{\beta}$), every $e \le d$ satisfies
--
--   $$A(e) \le 2\,(E + 8 d^{\beta})\, s^{\,1 + m(1-\beta)\log d}.$$
--
